<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 30.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 30.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   93/95     98/99     UNQ    163/166</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  97/99    100/103  173/175  183/185</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Bunker prices slipped late Monday, tracking weaker cargo levels. Traders said bunker prices were quoted firm earlier in the day but dipped after cargo strength buckled under selling pressure. But trades were scarce in a post-weekend mood, they said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
